flowchart TD
    A[Top hybrid candidates] --> B[Assign opaque candidate IDs]
    B --> C[Add bounded filename, location, signals, and content]
    C --> D{Request fits total token budget?}
    D -- No --> E[Reduce/truncate bounded candidate content]
    E --> D
    D -- Yes --> F[Structured model relevance ranking]
    F --> G{Locally valid IDs, scores, and uniqueness?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Apply reranked order; append omitted candidates stably]
    G -- No --> I[Fail open to hybrid order]
    F -. timeout/provider failure .-> I
    J[Skip when disabled, unnecessary, or too few bounded candidates] -.-> I
    H --> K[Final Top-K]
    I --> K

